--- !u!114 &2016301866
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2016301862}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e565258176e7b504780bc28f140ff124, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DreamInteraction
  kind: 3
  index: 1
  title: A gardener's last letter
  inscription: 'If you find our houses empty, seek the Keeper inside the castle. The Moon must remember before the garden can wake.


    The garden obeys three vows: roots endure in Ruin; dew gathers in Bloom; the last blossom opens in Ruin. Touch their seals in that order.


    E: read or interact. Q: shift at a memory stone. R: return to your last restored memory. The final arch requires Moon, Petal and Star.'
  indicator: {fileID: 1254817393}
