  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DreamInteraction
  kind: 3
  index: 0
  title: The pilgrim's inscription
  inscription: 'A seed slept beneath the abandoned gate. A lantern warmed its first leaf. A wing carried its blossom beyond the walls. Only then did a crown fall, and the sky remember its stars.


    In Bloom, wake the four names in the order of this journey. A false note silences the whole constellation.'
  indicator: {fileID: 1745092990}
